dence":["1 criterion line(s) bundle multiple deliverables with 'and' (split so each is independently verifiable).","AC item 'AC1 The spend-cap HCL is present on `main`, landed through Gerrit per `CONTRIBUT' cites operational evidence (merge_gate) that lives outside the codebase; tag it [non-codebase] — prefix the checkbox text with [non-codebase] so the completion verifier accepts a recorded attestation instead of failing to find code proof.","AC item 'AC3 The landed HCL matches the live resources, so `terraform plan` proposes zero' cites operational evidence (iac) that lives outside the codebase; tag it [non-codebase] — prefix the checkbox text with [non-codebase] so the completion verifier accepts a recorded attestation instead of failing to find code proof.","AC item 'AC7 The root cause is addressed, not just the instance: applying to production f' cites operational evidence (prod) that lives outside the codebase; tag it [non-codebase] — prefix the checkbox text with [non-codebase] so the completion verifier accepts a recorded attestation instead of failing to find code proof."],"finding":"Acceptance-criteria / definition-of-done quality issues.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"f607dd457c67f9209","impact":0.4,"is_primary":null,"location":"","norm_id":"ned06ebc801a522e3","priority":0.4,"reason":null,"recalled":false,"scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"Split compound criteria, replace subjective terms with observable outcomes, and state how each is verified.","tier":"DET","validity":1.0,"verification":null},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Broaden AC2's proving pattern to cover currency forms beyond '$N' (e.g. `grep -niE '(\\$ ?[0-9]|[0-9]+ ?(usd|dollars?|cents?))'`) across commit messages, README, and HCL comments.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5e","T7"],"criteria":["E6"],"decision":"advisory","decision_margin":-0.6062,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["Publication constraint: 'monetary figures do not go into committed guidance or history' and 'The branch's commit subject contains a literal currency amount.'","The pattern `\\$[0-9]` is anchored only to the '$N' form; taxonomy item (1): the anchor under-covers the stated criterion.","No handling for whitespace after '$' or word-form currency."],"finding":"AC2's proving command `grep -nE '\\$[0-9]'` only matches currency written with a leading '$' immediately followed by a digit; it will not catch monetary figures written as '5 USD', '5 dollars', '$ 5', or a bare threshold number in prose — yet the constraint bans 'a currency amount' / 'monetary figures' generally.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fa7197f7b45ce4e1a","impact":0.55,"is_primary":null,"location":"AC2 ('Checked: git log origin/main -p <files> | grep -nE '\\$[0-9]' returns nothing')","norm_id":"n7c546cd001c18f42","priority":0.3438,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["The rewritten commit message says '5 USD/day' instead of '$5'; the grep passes green while the banned figure remains in public history."],"severity":null,"suggested_fix":"Replace with `git log origin/main -p -- <files> | grep -niE '(\\$ ?[0-9]|[0-9][0-9., ]*(usd|dollar|cent))' returns nothing`, and confirm <files> resolves to bedrock_spend_cap.tf plus the README.","tier":"LLM","validity":0.625,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"na","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"underspecified_oracle","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_